---
import { ArrowRight } from '@lucide/astro';
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import { url } from '../lib/site';
---
<Base title="Now" active="Now">
  <section class="shell page-intro"><span class="eyebrow"><i class="status-dot"></i> Updated 4 October 2026</span><h1>What has my attention<span>.</span></h1><p>The work, questions, and experiments I'm spending time on.</p></section>
  <section class="shell now-layout"><div class="now-main"><article class="focus-item"><span class="focus-number">01</span><div><span class="eyebrow">At work</span><h2>Making data useful.</h2><p>Technical definition for data and reporting: connecting business needs to architecture, data contracts, and delivery. I'm also experimenting with AI agents in specification, implementation, and review.</p></div></article><article class="focus-item"><span class="focus-number">02</span><div><span class="eyebrow">Independent work</span><h2>Learning products with a review loop.</h2><p>Pulpo Oposiciones brings together source material, AI-assisted content generation, and a learning application. My interest is in the whole system, including how content is reviewed before publication.</p><a class="text-link" href={url('work/pulpo-oposiciones/')}>The project <ArrowRight size={17} aria-hidden="true" /></a></div></article><article class="focus-item"><span class="focus-number">03</span><div><span class="eyebrow">An ongoing question</span><h2>Where should an agent stop?</h2><p>Exploring the boundary between a flexible language interface and predictable operations: deterministic calculations, explicit state changes, and evidence a person can inspect.</p><a class="text-link" href={url('work/networthai/')}>The experiment <ArrowRight size={17} aria-hidden="true" /></a></div></article></div><aside class="now-aside"><span class="eyebrow">A small commitment</span><h2>Leave a record<br />of the work.</h2><p>Build something. Examine the result. Write down what changed.</p><div class="next-entry"><span class="eyebrow">Next to document</span><p>How source material becomes reviewed learning content in Pulpo.</p></div><a class="text-link" href={url('notes/')}>Read the field notes <ArrowRight size={17} aria-hidden="true" /></a></aside></section>
</Base>
